{"page":420,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:16","surah":33,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"قُل لَّن يَنفَعَكُمُ ٱلْفِرَارُ إِن فَرَرْتُم مِّنَ ٱلْمَوْتِ أَوِ ٱلْقَتْلِ وَإِذًا لَّا تُمَتَّعُونَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], say, ‘Running away will not benefit you. If you manage to escape death or slaughter, you will only be permitted to enjoy [life] for a short while.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّن","en_gloss":"Never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَنفَعَكُمُ","en_gloss":"will benefit you","transliteration":"yanfaʿakumu","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْفِرَارُ","en_gloss":"the fleeing","transliteration":"l-firāru","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَرَرْتُم","en_gloss":"you flee","transliteration":"farartum","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتِ","en_gloss":"death","transliteration":"l-mawti","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْقَتْلِ","en_gloss":"killing","transliteration":"l-qatli","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِذًۭا","en_gloss":"and then","transliteration":"wa-idhan","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُمَتَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be allowed to enjoy","transliteration":"tumattaʿūna","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"a little","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"33:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:16"}]},{"verse_key":"33:17","surah":33,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ مَن ذَا ٱلَّذِى يَعْصِمُكُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ إِنْ أَر