_id":85,"en":"When the believers saw the joint forces, they said, ‘This is what God and His Messenger promised us: the promise of God and His Messenger is true,’ and this only served to increase their faith and submission to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَءَا","en_gloss":"saw","transliteration":"raā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَحْزَابَ","en_gloss":"the confederates","transliteration":"l-aḥzāba","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَعَدَنَا","en_gloss":"Allah promised us","transliteration":"waʿadanā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah promised us","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūluhu","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَصَدَقَ","en_gloss":"and Allah spoke the truth","transliteration":"waṣadaqa","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah spoke the truth","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūluhu","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"زَادَهُمْ","en_gloss":"it increased them","transliteration":"zādahum","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) faith","transliteration":"īmānan","verse_key":"33:22"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَتَسْلِيمًۭا","en_g